# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# flake8: noqa: E501
"""ArduPilot PNT (Positioning, Navigation, Timing) Reference Audit -- data layer.

This module is the pure-data layer of the recreated PNT Reference Audit PDF
generator. It carries every audit table's row content as plain Python objects
and adds the new "New Service Location" mapping column for the AP_L1_Control
L1-navigation extraction (AAP 0.6.1).

Provenance
----------
The prior audit generator lived only in a gitignored ``tmp/pnt_work/`` tree and
was never committed, so the 94-row content is reconstructed here from the
committed repository-root ``ArduPilot_PNT_Reference_Audit.pdf`` (50 pages, A4
landscape, deterministic).  Every embedded code snippet is a verbatim 5-10 line
excerpt read from the audited source tree; the audited commit is an ancestor of
the current HEAD and every audited source file is byte-identical between them,
so the snippets match both the PDF and the live tree.

Reconciliation
--------------
* 63 Core (Tables 1-3) + 31 Indirect (Tables 4-6) = 94 main rows.
* 94 main rows x 3 layers (main + Layer 1 + Layer 2) = 282 evidence rows.
* 18 data objects: 6 main + 6 Layer-1 + 6 Layer-2 tables.

Notes on formatting
-------------------
Values transcribed from the Agent Action Plan drop the markdown code-span
backticks (markup, not content) but preserve every content character exactly,
including the Unicode ellipsis (…), rightwards arrow (→) and solidus (/).

The module is import-safe and deterministic: it performs no I/O, writes no PDF,
and has no import-time side effects.  It is consumed by ``pnt_render.py`` (the
renderer and verifier harness) and ``generate.py`` (the harness-gated entry
point).
"""


